  m_text: 'You need to cover three keys per hand: SDF and JKL. Position your index
    fingers on the F and J keys. Semicolon is backspace, and the spacebar is spacebar.


    From
    left to right, the keys on the brailler are 3-2-1-4-5-6.


    Press F1 for a
    braille cheat sheet!'
